  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Asia Hydrometeorology Modernization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Central Asia Hydrometeorology Modernization Project (CAHMP) is to improve the accuracy and timeliness of hydromet services in Central Asia, with particular focus on Kyrgyz Republic and Republic of Tajikistan.</narrative>
  </description>
